  "body": "As per #907 `<menuitem>` should now behave like `<option>`, but currently it doesn't perform reconstruction of the active formatting elements list. The reconstruction is expected by related tests:\nhttps://github.com/html5lib/html5lib-tests/blob/master/tree-construction/menuitem-element.dat#L97\n\nand implemented in Firefox (v48) and Chrome (v52)\n",
